# BEAM's Python dependencies for the RS1 mint (eval/custody/rs1/mint.sh), the subset its plan, question, answer,
# chat, truncate and probe stages import, with the versions BEAM's requirements.txt pins at b2da22e.
# requirements.lock pins them and every transitive dependency by hash. To regenerate it, save BEAM's requirements.txt
# at the pinned commit, without its en-core-web-sm URL line, as beam-constraints.txt beside this file, then run:
#   uv pip compile requirements.in -c beam-constraints.txt --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12 \
#     --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_28 -o requirements.lock
